<title>CANADA: Biovail says Tiazac ahead of target.</title>
<headline>Biovail says Tiazac ahead of target.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biovail Corp International said on Wednesday that sales of its lead drug, Tiazac, a daily dosage formulation of diltiazem, to Forest Laboratories Inc, Biovail's U.S. marketing partner, remained ahead of target and were expected to remain strong.</p>
<p>Forest said on Tuesday it intended to modify certain historical trade practices, but Biovail said the discontinuation of trade incentives would not affect the growth and market expansion of Tiazac, which was launched in the United States last February.</p>
</text>
